{"availability":"available","full":"Louis-CFM/coucou","name":"coucou","description":"A tiny friend in your Mac's notch and on your iPhone that keeps an eye on your AI coding agents: Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, Gemini CLI, Antigravity and more. Approve from the notch or your Lock Screen.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Swift","stars":5266,"forks":891,"created":"2026-09-27T21:54:12Z","updated":"2026-10-15T11:13:47Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://louis-cfm.github.io/coucou/","topics":["ai-agents","anthropic","antigravity","claude","claude-code","codex","cursor","dynamic-island","gemini-cli","ios","iphon","linux","macos","macos-app","menubar-app","notch","open-source","swift","swiftui","windows"],"demo":"https://louis-cfm.github.io/coucou/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T13:02:00.482Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-15T13:02:00.482Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-15T13:02:00.482Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T13:02:00.482Z","discoveredVia":[],"metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-09T16:41:39.019Z","stars":4420,"forks":743},{"at":"2026-10-10T17:25:22.480Z","stars":4654,"forks":775},{"at":"2026-10-11T04:29:16.493Z","stars":4716,"forks":780},{"at":"2026-10-15T13:02:00.482Z","stars":5266,"forks":891}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A tiny friend that lives in your Mac's notch — or at the top of your screen on Windows and Linux — and keeps an eye on your AI coding agent sessions. And now on your phone too: iPhone and Android.","Approve permissions, watch your agents work, drop a file, chat with Claude — all without leaving what you're doing. Walk away from your Mac and Mochi follows you to your iPhone: Lock Screen, Dynamic Island, widgets, Siri.","New in 0.4: Coucou is a real Mac app. Hold a key anywhere, speak, let go: your words are pasted where you type, like Wispr Flow — free, open source, and offline with Parakeet. Record your calls without a bot in the meeting and get the transcript, the summary and the to-dos."],"features":["✅ Approve and answer from the notch — Claude Code permission requests show up with Allow / Deny / Always; AskUserQuestion prompts show the choices right in the notch (single or multi-select, up to 4 questions). One…","🧑‍💻 Jump to the right terminal — open the exact terminal window of a session (macOS).","💬 Chat with Claude, Gemini, OpenAI, DeepSeek, Qwen, Moonshot, or a local model (Ollama / LM Studio) — click the model name above the chat box to switch provider and pick a model. Cloud providers use your own API key;…","📈 Portfolio pill (macOS) — track your crypto across 16 networks (Bitcoin, Ethereum, Solana, Polygon, BNB, Avalanche, Arbitrum, Optimism, Base, Dogecoin, Litecoin, TRON, XRP, Cardano, Cosmos, NEAR) and 5 exchanges…","📊 Claude plan usage (macOS, GitHub build) — a small pill in the notch header shows your 5-hour and weekly Claude plan limits. Enable it from Settings → Agents → Plan usage. Pro and Max plans only."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Louis-CFM/coucou/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"f419fb25033fad3c292dd0746f862ec89c60b572d4d708043430caa7aa2a6a14","extractedAt":"2026-10-15T13:02:00.584Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T13:02:00.584Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A tiny friend that lives in your Mac's notch — or at the top of your screen on Windows and Linux — and keeps an eye on your AI coding agent sessions. And now on your phone too: iPhone and Android.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Louis-CFM/coucou/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"documented","text":"🔒 Private by design — no telemetry, no account.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Louis-CFM/coucou/blob/main/README.md"},{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Coucou is coming to the Mac App Store and the iPhone App Store: one click to install, automatic updates, and the iPhone app pairs with your Mac through your iCloud account, with nothing to configure.","sourceU